#: savesettingswidget.cpp:75
msgid "Output file format:"
msgstr "Utgaavdateiformaat:"

#: savesettingswidget.cpp:77
msgid ""
"<p>Set here the output file format to use:</p><p><b>JPEG</b>: output the "
"processed image in JPEG Format. this format will give smaller-sized files. "
"Minimum JPEG compression level will be used during Raw conversion.</"
"p><p><b>Warning!!! duing of destructive compression algorithm, JPEG is a "
"lossy quality format.</b></p><p><b>TIFF</b>: output the processed image in "
"TIFF Format. This generates larges, without losing quality. Adobe Deflate "
"compression will be used during conversion.</p><p><b>PPM</b>: output the "
"processed image in PPM Format. This generates the largest files, without "
"losing quality.</p><p><b>PNG</b>: output the processed image in PNG Format. "
"This generates larges, without losing quality. Maximum PNG compression will "
"be used during conversion.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>Hier kannst Du dat Utgaavformaat fastleggen:</p><p><b>JPEG</b>: "
"Verarbeidt Biller warrt  in't JPEG-Formaat utgeven. Dit stellt lüttere "
"Dateien op. För't Ümwanneln warrt de lüttst JPEG-Komprimerenstoop bruukt.</"
"p><p><b>Wohrschoen! JPEG is en Dateiformaat mit Verlusten.</b></"
"p><p><b>TIFF</b>: Verarbeidt Biller warrt in't TIFF-Formaat utgeven. Dit "
"stellt grote Dateien ahn Verlusten op. För't Ümwanneln warrt de Deflate-"
"Komprimeren vun Adobe bruukt.</p><p><b>PPM</b>: Verarbeidt Biller warrt in't "
"PPM-Formaat utgeven. Dit stellt de gröttsten Dateien ahn Göödverlusten op.</"
"p><p><b>PNG</b>: Verarbeidt Biller warrt in't PNG-Formaat utgeven. Dit "
"stellt grote Biller ahn Verlusten op. För't Ümwanneln warrt de hööchste PNG-"
"Komprimeerstoop bruukt.</p>"

